<%#- ESCAPING: <%% emits runtime ERB into the generated view; a bare <% is
     consumed here at generation time. Never quote a closing ERB tag inside a
     comment — a literal one terminates the comment early and leaks the rest
     of this prose into the generated file.

     Emitted ONCE per app into app/views/shared/. The `--css=` marker below is
     how a later scaffold run detects a variant mismatch — keep it. -%>
<%%# locals: (message: nil) -%>
<%%# Shared field-error line (--css=<%= css_variant %>), rendered by every
    scaffolded form. %>
<%% if message.present? %>
  <p<%= css_attr(:error_text) %>><%%= message %></p>
<%% end %>
